Precondition: candidate_created origin_availability_alpha (yes), not vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha (we haven't allocated yet), vehicle_available vehicle_unit_alpha (init true). Effect: vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha, candidate_vehicle_linked origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha, not vehicle_available vehicle_unit_alpha.

Step6: attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
Precondition: candidate_created origin_availability_alpha, vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha, route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha (init true). Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, not route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha.

Step7: confirm_candidate_preparedness origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
Precondition: candidate_created origin_availability_alpha, vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha, candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, not candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha. Effect: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha.

Step8: assign_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha
Precondition: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha, operator_available driver_operator_alpha (init true). Effect: candidate_operator_linked origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha, not operator_available driver_operator_alpha.

