Precondition: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha, candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha (init), not origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha (init false), not origin_node_occupied origin_node_alpha (init false). Effect: origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha.

Step10: lock_origin_availability origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha
Precondition: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha, candidate_operator_linked origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha, origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha, origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha, not origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha. Effect: origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha, origin_availability_confirmed origin_availability_alpha.

